{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27610","headline":"周员外席上观柘枝 · 张祜","name":"周员外席上观柘枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画鼓拖环锦臂攘，小娥双换舞衣裳。\n金丝蹙雾红衫薄，银蔓垂花紫带长。\n鸾影乍回头并举，凤声初歇翅齐张。\n一时欻腕招残拍，斜敛轻身拜玉郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}